close_reason: A quiet passing pm test --run now reports only the decision fields of execution_context in TOON and JSON; --check-context restores the full context
contract_change:
  api: pm test --run TOON and JSON output (execution_context)
  before: "A passing run without --lean printed the full execution_context: sandbox and source tracker paths, item counts, seeding flags, the working directory and the trust object with its fingerprint"
  after: "A passing, mismatch-free run with no failure category prints pm_context_mode, workspace_context_mode, mismatch_detected, trusted, trust_reason and a restore_with hint in every format; failures, refusals, skips and mismatches keep the full context"
  migrate: "Read trusted and trust_reason instead of trust.trusted and trust.reason on passing runs, or pass --check-context to keep the full context with every path, count and the trust fingerprint; SDK runTest results are unchanged"
